# Brainrototo.com — Frontend Architecture

## Stack (V1 — do not diverge without explicit ask)

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| Framework | Next.js 16 + React 19 + TypeScript (strict) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS 4 + CSS variables for design tokens |
| Motion | Motion (CSS first for pure visuals) |
| 3D | CSS only unless Three.js is explicitly needed |
| UI | Homegrown components; shadcn/ui only as optional base |
| State | React state; Zustand only if shared state needs it |
| Validation | Zod |
| Data V1 | TypeScript/JSON files — no e-commerce backend yet |
| Deploy | Vercel |
| Tests | Vitest + Playwright |
| Lint | ESLint + Prettier |

Avoid `any`. No business logic dumped in templates. No overengineering the MVP.

## Folder shape (feature-based)

```
features/   home | generator | brainrot | products | cart
shared/     components | hooks | utils
data/       brainrots | products | traits | brand
models/     domain types
```

## Data-driven UI

Brainrots and products are **data**, never hardcoded in components.

```ts
interface Brainrototo {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  animal: string;
  ingredient: string;
  vibe: string;
  image: string;
  rarity?: 'common' | 'rare' | 'epic' | 'legendary';
}

interface Product {
  id: string;
  type: 'tshirt' | 'hoodie' | 'cap';
  name: string;
  baseImage: string;
}
```

Swap `staticBrainrots.ts` for an API later without rewriting UI.

## State (keep simple)

`selectedAnimal` | `selectedIngredient` | `selectedVibe` | `selectedBrainrot` | `selectedProduct`

## Assets

Centralize under `assets/brainrots|products|decorations|fonts`. Images replaceable without touching components. Prefer WebP/AVIF; lazy-load non-critical.

## A11y & perf

Keyboard-accessible controls, meaningful alt, contrast, `prefers-reduced-motion`. Prefer CSS animations; no libraries for trivial effects.
